WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.509
Jason led Vinnie and Mandy out of the house.

2
00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:09.817
"We'll pass through the agora.

3
00:00:09.818 --> 00:00:14.876
It is the heart of our city," said Jason.

4
00:00:14.877 --> 00:00:18.335
"This is where people buy and sell things.

5
00:00:18.336 --> 00:00:22.373
We make the laws of Athens here too.

6
00:00:22.374 --> 00:00:29.400
Men, women, and slaves can be together in the agora."

7
00:00:29.401 --> 00:00:32.808
Suddenly, Mandy pulled Vinnie’s arm.

8
00:00:32.809 --> 00:00:34.628
"Look at that!"

9
00:00:34.629 --> 00:00:36.823
She pointed upward.

10
00:00:36.824 --> 00:00:41.391
"Whoa!" Vinnie said, stopping.

11
00:00:41.392 --> 00:00:45.012
He stared up at a tall, rocky hill.

12
00:00:45.013 --> 00:00:48.134
Many stairs led up to the top.

13
00:00:48.135 --> 00:00:52.607
At the top were many buildings.

14
00:00:52.608 --> 00:00:57.678
"There’s the Parthenon," said Jason. "Isn’t it great?"

15
00:00:57.679 --> 00:01:03.689
He pointed out a large building surrounded by tall, white columns.

16
00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:08.500
"It’s beautiful!" Mandy gasped.

17
00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:11.951
"I can surely tell you’re not from here.

18
00:01:11.952 --> 00:01:15.874
Where are you from?" Jason asked.

19
00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:22.067
"From New Jersey." Vinnie said nervously.

20
00:01:22.068 --> 00:01:27.219
"I have never heard of New Jersey," said Jason, frowning.

21
00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.375
They reached the agora.

22
00:01:29.376 --> 00:01:31.540
People were everywhere.

23
00:01:31.541 --> 00:01:35.998
"Jason!" a man called. "Here’s some bread.

24
00:01:35.999 --> 00:01:38.205
You have to eat a lot to win the race!"

25
00:01:38.206 --> 00:01:41.143
He held out a loaf.

26
00:01:41.144 --> 00:01:44.694
"Thank you!" said Jason.

27
00:01:44.695 --> 00:01:49.877
Another voice yelled, "Jason, your lyre has been fixed!

28
00:01:49.878 --> 00:01:53.884
Come by later to pick it up."

29
00:01:53.885 --> 00:01:57.675
"Can you play that instrument?" asked Vinnie.

30
00:01:57.676 --> 00:02:00.393
"Sure," said Jason.

31
00:02:00.394 --> 00:02:03.279
"I learn music at the gymnasium."

32
00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:09.549
"Good luck, Jason!" called out three more voices.

33
00:02:09.550 --> 00:02:15.518
"I will compete in the sprint race at the Olympic Games," said Jason.

34
00:02:15.519 --> 00:02:17.994
"The race will be held in Olympia.

35
00:02:17.995 --> 00:02:22.935
I am the youngest runner, but I am the fastest."

36
00:02:22.936 --> 00:02:28.097
"I love watching the Olympics!" said Mandy.

37
00:02:28.098 --> 00:02:32.501
Jason stared at her with his mouth wide open.

38
00:02:32.502 --> 00:02:36.564
"Women are not allowed to watch the games!"

39
00:02:36.565 --> 00:02:40.829
"Jason!" a tall man called out.

40
00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:44.380
He was a few years older than Jason.

41
00:02:44.381 --> 00:02:47.133
He walked up to Mandy and Vinnie.

42
00:02:47.134 --> 00:02:48.833
"My name is Milo.

43
00:02:48.834 --> 00:02:52.608
I am the fastest runner in Athens!"

44
00:02:52.609 --> 00:02:57.157
"But I thought . . . ," said Vinnie, pointing to Jason.

45
00:02:57.158 --> 00:03:01.939
"Did he tell you he was the best? Ha-ha!" laughed Milo.

46
00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:06.322
"Everyone knows that I will wear the olive wreath of victory this year!"

47
00:03:06.323 --> 00:03:11.679
"Milo, stop bragging," said Jason with a half smile.

48
00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:16.605
"After the race begins, you will see me far ahead of you!"

49
00:03:16.606 --> 00:03:18.592
He turned to Mandy.

50
00:03:18.593 --> 00:03:22.536
"You must stay in the agora now," Jason said.

51
00:03:22.537 --> 00:03:25.136
"We’re going to the gymnasium."

52
00:03:25.137 --> 00:03:30.735
Surprised, Mandy cried, "No, I want to come with you!"

53
00:03:30.736 --> 00:03:32.868
Jason shook his head.

54
00:03:32.869 --> 00:03:35.446
"Girls aren’t allowed inside.

55
00:03:35.447 --> 00:03:38.479
You must wait here until we come out."

56
00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.812
Mandy stamped her foot.

57
00:03:40.813 --> 00:03:47.966
She hated being left out.

